    "summary": "Only a model combining **LEGIONES DAEMONICA**, **TZEENTCH** and **MONSTER** qualifies. In your Shooting phase, this applies when you choose the bearer’s unit to fire. An enemy unit that a friendly **TZEENTCH** **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** unit can see gains 9 inches of detection range while that visibility lasts. The bonus ends once the bearer’s unit finishes shooting. Apply the sight and distance rules for [Hidden](vsdata:core-rule/hidden) using the enemy unit’s increased range.",
